[{"title":"江行","author":"王君谟","text":"暮云含雨意，江路转凄清。\n夜泊扁舟处，时闻孤雁声。\n莫愁秋欲老，只是客关情。\n不信他乡恨，吟边分外生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":15187,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"君山浮远堂","author":"王呈瑞","text":"万室东南里，炊烟落照黄。\n山腰围野阔，沙尾刺江长。\n好景终然远，浮云转已亡。\n几多如湛辈，今昔一凄凉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":15188,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"石门洞","author":"王孝严","text":"天下洞天三十六，玄鹤洞天一仙谷。\n两山对峙一如门，深崖百丈垂飞瀑。\n青牛往矣不复见，白云空锁故山麓。\n奇哉胜地得人胜，至今俗客来忘俗。\n向来我实劳梦想，一旦登临快心目。\n寻师访道语未罢，扶藜上朝玄水渌。\n九天云绽漏?雨，一沼波翻溅琼玉。\n亭高喷雪逼人寒，地冷风霜满空蔌。\n老龙底事不知倦，雷泽千年无断续。\n必是分潢天上来，便欲穷源驾黄鹄。\n康乐曾登最高处，谪仙几向岩前宿。\n壁间禅压已有诗，想见思泉倾万斛。\n安得前人不道句，更与羲仙醉时读。\n千峰如峡苍波束，二十四滩犹箭速。\n转头溪风一棹寒，但效双凫到山曲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":15189,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"舫斋","author":"王孝严","text":"我本湖漘一漫郎，生来住处波茫茫。\n时寻画舸破烟水，菰蒲满路荷花香。\n一川窈窕诧红蓼，两岸芦苇明秋霜。\n船头鸥鸟日来往，溪上风月相迎将。\n一行作吏便相失，合眼灵运春池塘。\n纷纷雁鹜实可厌，纸尾姓字随低昂。\n簿书终是俗人甚，江湖到了难相忘。\n公馀赖有数椽在，疏棂两行如船装。\n不知风波世路险，稳著万斛随风樯。\n人生短篷何日近，向来苕霅今括苍。\n江山转柁千万里，故人两地遥相望。\n谁能为我幻竹叶，顷刻泛宅归沧浪。\n祇凭平生气湖海，随所寓处为艅艎。\n夜寒满载明月窗，北风打头人不忙。\n动来况自不如静，悔吝不到虚舟傍。\n胸襟五湖与三江，是中莫测谁望洋。\n直须唤取李郭辈，相与共泛无何乡。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":15190,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"念奴娇","author":"王孝严","text":"昨宵灰动，有阶前春草，侵凌春雪。\n碧玉堂前为寿处，齐祝遐龄千百。\n夜冷笙箫，庭深灯火，应照梅妆额。\n容华依旧，向来姑射标格。\n独恨绾系日边，东风回首，还有溪山隔。\n怅望云飞，凝伫久，空使怀英心折。\n遥折一枝，饱斟花露，再拜瞻南极。\n愿言来岁，凤池同看春色。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":15191,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再游园亭","author":"王宏","text":"一夜春膏涨碧溪，水滨沙际润无泥。\n幽人绿野临江曲，太守红旗转竹西。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":15192,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二","author":"王宏","text":"青女横霜夜，神炉盛冻天。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":15193,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其一","author":"王宏","text":"春来赏遍牡丹春，江上侯家迥出群。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":15194,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送蓝峰赴南泉教","author":"王希旦","text":"君去清源第一州，鲙鱼沽酒有人留。\n泉山紫帽登临处，还有高人寄我不。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":15195,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"本觉寺三过堂","author":"王希吕","text":"门外惊风吹细沙，入门水气湛清华。\n呼童试向林间看，岩桂应开第二花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":15196,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"学士院入直赋景物二首 其二","author":"王希吕","text":"小池倒影弄馀辉，照耀虚檐极出奇。\n木杪不鸣风力软，闯萍翻藻有鱼嬉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":15197,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"学士院入直赋景物二首 其一","author":"王希吕","text":"玉堂昼永暑风微，蔌蔌飞花落小池。\n徙倚幽栏凭问讯，夏莺飞出万年枝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":15198,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"湖山十咏 其十","author":"王希吕","text":"窗外平畴交远风，豆花成实谷苗丰。\n向来河朔经行地，尽在江南烟雨中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":15199,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"湖山十咏 其四","author":"王希吕","text":"冥冥细雨不成泥，十里平沙快马蹄。\n总为好山牵醉眼，不知纵辔过西溪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":15200,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"湖山十咏 其二","author":"王希吕","text":"石罅微泉咽浅沙，沙头细草换年华。\n疏篱酒旆管春事，倚马短檐梅著花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":15201,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"湖山十咏 其九","author":"王希吕","text":"荷花过眼作鲜妍，小艇初疑久自便。\n日日孤山山下路，红菱白藕不论钱。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":15202,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"湖山十咏 其八","author":"王希吕","text":"露葵抱蕊未全开，翠竹阴凉蔽绿苔。\n贪看青林飞白鸟，丁丁啄木又惊回。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":15203,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"湖山十咏 其五","author":"王希吕","text":"雨挟东风作嫩寒，短墙围水柳藏烟。\n游人不出西湖静，白鹭飞来在画船。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":15204,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"湖山十咏 其七","author":"王希吕","text":"山光拥翠落杯中，水色天容上下同。\n身入蓬山人不悟，碧桃无数倚春风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":15205,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"湖山十咏 其一","author":"王希吕","text":"瑟瑟轻冰拆御沟，沟边柳色弄春柔。\n数声啼鸟破幽梦，断送西湖寻旧游。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":15206,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"湖山十咏 其六","author":"王希吕","text":"雨后桃花脱瘦红，钩窗平揖竹閒风。\n文书满案不经意，心在西湖山水中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":15207,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"湖山十咏 其三","author":"王希吕","text":"山南山北异阴晴，雨脚垂垂日脚明。\n落尽桃花春事退，柔桑深处一鸠鸣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":15208,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"王希吕","text":"燕居九见岁华周，晚得湖湘斗大州。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":15209,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送子应梅入太学","author":"王希淮","text":"璧流天下士，取友戒荒嬉。\n家国关身重，乡园得梦迟。\n子行虽不恶，我老自堪疑。\n莫似辽东鹤，悠悠不可期。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":15210,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"天童寺","author":"王应麟","text":"十里青松接翠微，梵王宫殿白云飞。\n钟声出岫客初到，月色满庭僧未归。\n偶有閒情依净土，竟无尘虑渎天机。\n明朝尚有登高兴，千仞冈头一振衣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":15211,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"东山","author":"王应麟","text":"东山美周公，千载邈遗音。\n槃槃谢家安，陈迹犹可寻。\n仰睇虞峰高，俯挹娥涛深。\n伟人不可作，感慨生登临。\n典午鼎岌岌，日夕照忠忱。\n谈笑沮温谋，尊俎却氐侵。\n斯民免为鱼，清风濯釜鬵。\n抚筝疑未释，西州复沾衿。\n紫囊皆少年，秉钺扫云阴。\n茂绩世茅土，有孙亦璆琳。\n祚移卯金刀，志士皆噎喑。\n曷不效靖节，种菊遁幽林。\n既縻无嘉爵，空怀子房心。\n鸿鸣九霄远，雉翳嗟珍禽。\n行藏异危逊，览古得良箴。\n吾游几入越，独欠隮崟岑。\n晋士岂清谈，底柱屹江浔。\n翠屏倚空碧，浮云更古今。\n永言广武叹，谁续洛生吟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":15212,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"东钱湖","author":"王应麟","text":"湖草青青湖水平，酒航西渡入空明。\n月波夜静银浮镜，霞屿春深锦作屏。\n丞相祠前惟古柏，读书台上但啼莺。\n年年谢豹花开日，犹有游人作伴行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":15213,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"吴刺史庙","author":"王应麟","text":"城西有祠临水涘，翠松列植路如砥。\n问之耆老此为谁，唐大历中吴刺史。\n刺史为民开陂湖，故迹犹传堰九里。\n年年箫鼓报丰穰，决渠为雨润泽美。\n遗爱有桥名怀恩，姓名不载太史氏。\n昔汉吴公治第一，列传寂寂名无纪。\n刺史岂其苗裔欤，明州政亦河南比。\n堂上大书荆公诗，兰菊春秋百世祀。\n地志祇称王长官，有功于民盖一揆。\n吾闻是邦多贤守，裴王碑字颜与李。\n惟侯盛德著人心，彼石可焚祠弗圮。\n广德湖为鸿隙陂，召棠栾社谁敢毁。\n粳稌充羡侯之赐，庙食长存如此水。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":15214,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"吴刺史庙祭神辞","author":"王应麟","text":"坎击鼓兮鄞水浒，思仁侯兮昔召父。\n堰九里兮酾流为雨，水泱泱兮芃芃麦黍。\n鸿隙堙兮谣豆芋，侯嘉绩兮依其在渚。\n神之来兮飙轮下，兰觞勺兮荐椒糈。\n民不忘侯兮歌且舞，侯不忘民兮俾宁宇。\n神之归兮娭瑶圃，格颢穹兮降多祜。\n娄丰穰兮除疾苦，年千世百兮保艾吾土。\n事侯如存兮侯其福女，敬共承祀兮无怠终古。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":15215,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"唐开成年墓志石","author":"王应麟","text":"鸿濛肇开辟，变嬗几成毁。\n寥寥断竹歌，瓦堲溯姚姒。\n周坟典以族，讵认青乌子。\n公琴记咎繇，邢山称东里。\n葛淯失之矫，璠玙过于侈。\n焉知宫夹墓，莫识龟言水。\n铜槃字十六，铭自比于始。\n延陵有孔篆，乌宁半辞止。\n汉砖犹简朴，石章寖华靡。\n无愧惟有道，媚俗多虚美。\n七松谈士良，何以惩不轨。\n载笔鲜南董，袭浮谬臧否。\n岂悟冢中人，三百年不死。\n妇名弗出阃，古未有碑诔。\n谥见春秋初，志起典午氏。\n簪蒿隐士妻，芳刻垂千祀。\n杨高托不朽，习之文中理。\n或犯葵丘禁，息国事何耻。\n蛾眉为黄土，磨灭更谁纪。\n宰如比何人，维邑之士女。\n逸民孺仲裔，冰雪濯纨绮。\n采俪古鄞州，俭勤终莫齿。\n试问几何年，颇与铜人似。\n虽微黄绢辞，亦质而不俚。\n丘夷池又平，蓬颗今廛市。\n聚庐寒劫灰，馀光辉泥滓。\n曰德巢由俦，闺曰莱鸿比。\n我行松柏下，势荣朝菌尔。\n隆碣牛砺角，翁仲卧荆杞。\n兰艾均一尘，玉珉同一燬。\n孤竹梦泡然，柳下垄孰是。\n片石幸有传，诗以贻彤史。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":15216,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"望春山","author":"王应麟","text":"群峰西南起还伏，湖上丹丘立于独。\n神仙寓迹山水间，不在幽深在清淑。\n松潭水暖龙欲起，蕙帐人空鹤自宿。\n飞云晓驭紫琼车，沆瀣宵涵白银屋。\n蓬莱之名不可思，俗客须当避尔躅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":15217,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"鳖山","author":"王应麟","text":"天柱不可折，柱折不可撑。\n九鼎不可覆，鼎覆人莫扛。\n袁公烈丈夫，独立东南方。\n欲以一己力，代国相颉颃。\n适遭宋祚移，耻为不义戕。\n奋然抱志起，誓欲扫搀枪。\n拔剑突前麾，手回日月光。\n敌势愈猖獗，山摧失忠良。\n呜呼绝伦志，不得骋才长。\n妻孥悉从溺，枯骨谁为襄。\n忠烈动天地，游魂为国殇。\n山水倍堪悲，抱恨彻穹苍。\n穹苍幸一息，庶几纪星霜。\n西风白杨路，哀猿号崇冈。\n解剑挂墓柏，泣下沾衣裳。\n惜哉时不利，抽毫述悲伤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":15218,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"配食大成乐章 酌献沂国公","author":"王应麟","text":"公传自曾，孟传自公。\n有的绪承，允得其宗。\n提纲开缊，乃作中庸。\n侑于元圣，亿载是崇。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":15219,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"配食大成乐章 酌献郕国公","author":"王应麟","text":"心传忠恕，一以贯之。\n爰述太学，万世训彝。\n惠我光明，尊闻行知。\n继圣迪后，是享是宜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":15220,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"口占谢高簿送锦薰笼","author":"王志道","text":"一种薰笼出锦机，殷勤遣送到书帏。\n自惭不是裁花手，沾得仇香香满衣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":15221,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"岁朝轿中伊轧声类橹舟因感旧游","author":"王志道","text":"岁朝伊轧上蓝舆，酷似当年在帝都。\n柔橹数声杨柳外，小舟逗晓过西湖。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":15222,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"侨寄山居霍然几月凡见之于目闻之于耳者辄缀成绝句名之曰田园杂兴非敢比石湖聊以写一时闲适之趣云尔 其七","author":"王志道","text":"自从巡尉罢搜茶，便觉山中气象嘉。\n卖得钱来供饱饭，尚馀醉酒插山花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":15223,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"侨寄山居霍然几月凡见之于目闻之于耳者辄缀成绝句名之曰田园杂兴非敢比石湖聊以写一时闲适之趣云尔 其四","author":"王志道","text":"早蚕上箔将成茧，晚界蚕方起大眠。\n两月辛勤敢胥怨，成丝成绢更成绵。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":15224,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"侨寄山居霍然几月凡见之于目闻之于耳者辄缀成绝句名之曰田园杂兴非敢比石湖聊以写一时闲适之趣云尔 其二","author":"王志道","text":"羃羃黄云麦垄秋，牧童横笛倒骑牛。\n百金买得葫芦扇，持向田头蔽日头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":15225,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"侨寄山居霍然几月凡见之于目闻之于耳者辄缀成绝句名之曰田园杂兴非敢比石湖聊以写一时闲适之趣云尔 其三","author":"王志道","text":"雨过天青似蔚蓝，碧云收入鳠鱼潭。\n蚕姑举手交相庆，趁得新晴老却蚕。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":15226,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"侨寄山居霍然几月凡见之于目闻之于耳者辄缀成绝句名之曰田园杂兴非敢比石湖聊以写一时闲适之趣云尔 其九","author":"王志道","text":"樵得田头二麦归，做成饼饵饱妻儿。\n农家喜有耘田本，接到籼禾稻熟时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":15227,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"侨寄山居霍然几月凡见之于目闻之于耳者辄缀成绝句名之曰田园杂兴非敢比石湖聊以写一时闲适之趣云尔 其一","author":"王志道","text":"幽居无事属山家，闭却柴门日未斜。\n啼鸟一声惊梦觉，小窗闲坐听蜂衙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":15228,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"侨寄山居霍然几月凡见之于目闻之于耳者辄缀成绝句名之曰田园杂兴非敢比石湖聊以写一时闲适之趣云尔 其十","author":"王志道","text":"新竹成林犹带粉，早秧出水便成针。\n日长门巷无人过，一觉齁齁夏木阴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":15229,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"侨寄山居霍然几月凡见之于目闻之于耳者辄缀成绝句名之曰田园杂兴非敢比石湖聊以写一时闲适之趣云尔 其五","author":"王志道","text":"树头桑叶似穿钱，准拟今年贱似前。\n谁信天公难预料，今年却贵似常年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":15230,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和岘窗韵是日也适赴座主西湖社日之宴","author":"王志道","text":"雨馀西子湿香腮，那得心情滞酒杯。\n浪逐画船分社饭，也教人道赏春来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":15231,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和秋浦闻鸡偶成","author":"王志道","text":"窗前银烛焰将暗，楼上梅花引已残。\n忽听鸡鸣思起舞，百年王业尚偏安。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":15232,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和高簿送梅 其三","author":"王志道","text":"标格清奇压众葩，数枝频到士元家。\n情知老大花应笑，强饮从教醉眼斜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":15233,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和高簿送梅 其二","author":"王志道","text":"多君时送早春葩，不减孤山处士家。\n留取水窗和月看，夜深疏影正横斜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":15234,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和高簿送梅 其六","author":"王志道","text":"花底莓苔蒲树丫，翠翘玉珥碧襦纱。\n靓妆雅器鸣琴友，不向朱门听鼓笳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":15235,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和高簿送梅 其五","author":"王志道","text":"远望青山两髻丫，水纹风细绉如纱。\n不知游冶谁家子，也捲黄芦学塞笳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":15236,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和高簿送梅 其四","author":"王志道","text":"屈曲溪桥路两丫，淡烟如隔小棂纱。\n南枝已入诗人手，三弄从教咽暮笳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":15237,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和高簿送梅 其一","author":"王志道","text":"文如翻水艳天葩，始信才猷属故家。\n为爱新吟贪咀嚼，霜髭撚断日西斜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":15238,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和谭云翔送双桂韵","author":"王志道","text":"双桂婆娑天上花，殷勤分送士元家。\n捷钤果副联鞯祝，谒谢当期谷旦差。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":15239,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋早过湖","author":"王志道","text":"漠漠轻云冒两山，楼台依约有无间。\n画船未出波光定，一目新鸿度柳湾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":15240,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄兴","author":"王志道","text":"五湖深处足逍遥，错把扁舟系柳条。\n尘世不如烟水阔，笑骑黄鹤上层霄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":15241,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"渔父","author":"王志道","text":"岸芷汀兰曲曲春，绿蓑青箬老江濆。\n倚船三弄东风恶，吹断巫山片片云。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":15242,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"六月八日夜步西湖即事","author":"王志道","text":"步绕西湖路，荷盘送晚香。\n归舟初袅缆，斜月已侵廊。\n水外钟声杳，风前曲韵长。\n剨然思远举，逸兴渺难量。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":15243,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和半庵庆成诗韵","author":"王志道","text":"重屋祗承敬勿休，前星主鬯贰凝旒。\n度筵九尺陈黄目，助祭诸王未白头。\n精意已知通烈祖，仪文元不减圜丘。\n两阶屡舞苗民格，何况金穰岁有秋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":15244,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽赵右司","author":"王志道","text":"化瑟初更世道清，宗臣只合在朝廷。\n谋猷况已弥台衮，姓字尤当列御屏。\n不向红云鸣玉佩，却随丹旐引刍灵。\n象贤喜有金闺彦，全似先生旧典刑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":15245,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赋江湖伟观","author":"王志道","text":"东南王气萃钱塘，襟带江湖国势强。\n万顷烟波流德泽，四时弦管乐丰穰。\n帆归别浦鱼盐聚，雨过平堤草木香。\n欲赋上林才不逮，举头三祝寿无疆。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":15246,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"简中朝贵人","author":"王志道","text":"场屋辛勤债未偿，又随宦辙到河阳。\n米无五斗腰徒折，醋有三升鼻惯尝。\n屡典朝衣赒过客，时沽坊酒涤愁肠。\n此心对越知无愧，午夜炉香乞岁穰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":15247,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题大禹庙","author":"王志道","text":"古木夹幽径，森严夏禹祠。\n阴云护陵寝，遗庙锁蛟螭。\n窆石今犹在，梅梁事亦奇。\n道人情意厚，邀我读残碑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":15248,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"五言","author":"王志道","text":"颇得山居趣，悠然醉复醒。\n闭门延爽气，数竹寄闲情。\n清磬敲残月，寒潭浴晓星。\n谁能牵世网，汩汩苦劳生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":15249,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}}]